1
00:00:00,302 --> 00:00:02,092
(Sheldon:)What is it now, Mrs. Wolowitz?

2
00:00:02,262 --> 00:00:03,722
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)It's this dress.

3
00:00:03,889 --> 00:00:08,309
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)When I put my front in,
my back pops out.

4
00:00:10,354 --> 00:00:15,104
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)When I put my back in,
my front pops out.

5
00:00:15,317 --> 00:00:18,907
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)It's like trying to keep two dogs
in a bathtub.

6
00:00:21,532 --> 00:00:23,202
(Sheldon:)What do you want me to do?

7
00:00:23,367 --> 00:00:25,447
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)We're gonna have to work as a team.

8
00:00:25,619 --> 00:00:29,919
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Get in here, grab a handful,
and start stuffing.

9
00:00:36,505 --> 00:00:39,255
(Sheldon(off):)I'm not sure how to do this.

10
00:00:39,424 --> 00:00:44,594
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)It's easy. Just pretend
you're putting away a sleeping bag.

11
00:00:45,722 --> 00:00:50,062
(Sheldon(off):)Sleeping bags don't usually
sweat this much, but okay.

12
00:00:51,019 --> 00:00:52,349
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Now zip me up.

13
00:00:52,521 --> 00:00:59,021
(Sheldon(off):)Oh, if we squeeze you any tighter,
you might turn into a diamond.

